      "summary": [
        "Implemented `mcp-server/src/gui/model-registry.ts` with all required public functions and schemas, and `mcp-server/tests/gui/model-registry.test.ts` covering all 13 acceptance criteria. All 47 unit tests pass; no regressions in adjacent test files."
