          "timestamp": "2026-07-21T13:34:47Z",
          "note": "AC-1 slug regex /^[a-z0-9]+(-[a-z0-9]+)*$/ — verified boundary conditions: trailing hyphen, leading hyphen, consecutive hyphens (all rejected), single alphanumeric (accepted). Implementation is correct."
