          "type": "improvement",
          "priority": "low",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-21T13:34:47Z",
          "note": "loadDefaults() early-return path: when toAdd.length === 0 AND conflicts.length === 0, returns { models: locals, conflicts: [] } without a disk write. Correct behavior — idempotent re-invocation is safe."
